==Location and Uses==
==={{TWW|-}}===
{{Stub|TWW}}

==={{TP|-}}===
Red Chu Jelly can be obtained in the [[Lakebed Temple]], [[Hyrule Field]], [[Snowpeak Ruins]], and [[Cave|Caves]]. After defeating a [[Red Chuchu|Red Chu]], Link can collect Red Chu Jelly in an [[Empty Bottle]]. Drinking it will have the same effect as [[Red Potion|Red Potions]] and restores eight [[Heart|Hearts]].

==={{BotW|-}}===
Red Chuchu Jelly can be obtained by killing [[Fire Chuchu]]s, or by killing [[Chuchu]]s with [[Fire]] [[Weapon]]s. It can also be made from regular [[Chuchu Jelly]] by setting it on Fire. If struck with a Weapon, it explodes and releases a ball of fire that sets nearby [[Enemy|Enemies]] on fire. Red Chuchu Jelly can be used to [[Cooking|Cook]] [[Elixir|Elixirs]].

Red Chuchu Jelly is also used to upgrade the [[Snowquill Set]] of [[Armor]] to its first and second tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. 
